  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ACCORD Core Support 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support to ACCORD in line with their 2017-2021  Strategy . The planned effects for the target group are :
1	Reinforced institutional capacity of the African Union (AU) and regional economic communities (RECS)
2	Strengthened local and national capacities for peace
3	Enhanced role of women in peace processes
4	Increased role of youth in peace processes
5	Increased knowledge, policy support and response to the drivers of conflict
6	Effective and coordinated early warning and co</narrative>
  </description>
